slider4:2<0,7,1{Low Shelf,High Shelf,Peaking,Low Pass,High Pass,Notch,Band Pass,All Pass}>Low Type
slider5:0<0,2,1{Active,Bypass,Solo}>Low Mode
slider6:548<300,1000,1>Low Mid Freq (Hz)
slider7:0<-18,18,0.1>Low Mid Gain (dB)
slider8:1.0<0.1,10.0,0.1>Low Mid Q
slider9:2<0,7,1{Low Shelf,High Shelf,Peaking,Low Pass,High Pass,Notch,Band Pass,All Pass}>Low Mid Type
slider10:0<0,2,1{Active,Bypass,Solo}>Low Mid Mode
slider11:2236<1000,5000,1>Mid High Freq (Hz)
slider12:0<-18,18,0.1>Mid High Gain (dB)
slider13:1.0<0.1,10.0,0.1>Mid High Q
slider14:2<0,7,1{Low Shelf,High Shelf,Peaking,Low Pass,High Pass,Notch,Band Pass,All Pass}>Mid High Type
slider15:0<0,2,1{Active,Bypass,Solo}>Mid High Mode
slider16:10000<5000,20000,1>High Freq (Hz)
slider17:0<-18,18,0.1>High Gain (dB)
slider18:1.0<0.1,10.0,0.1>High Q
slider19:2<0,7,1{Low Shelf,High Shelf,Peaking,Low Pass,High Pass,Notch,Band Pass,All Pass}>High Type
